{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AZ overslept all the way until homeroom was over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I really need to go home...&quot; <br>But something is wrong\u2014the schoolyard has changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the darkness, strange and unknown creatures begin to appear.<br>Now, survival is the only goal. And there's only one way: turn the familiar into weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Unique Combat with School Supplies</strong><br>Fight using pencils, rulers, scissors, and more!<br>Stab with pencils, slash with rulers, spin-cut with scissors\u2014<br>ordinary supplies become powerful weapons in satisfying combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>One Character, Infinite Growth</strong><br>Only one character, but endless possibilities!<br>A random mission system unlocks dozens of combat styles.<br>Each run is new. Each run, you grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Pixel Graphics &amp; Nostalgic Vibes</strong><br>Relive school days with cute pixel art and analog charm.<br>A simple, cozy feeling set in a familiar schoolyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>The More You Play, The Stronger You Get</strong><br>Unlock permanent upgrades through repeated play.<br>Survive longer and dive deeper in a meta-loop of endless growth!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966360?t=1771438237","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966360/fea94d31f5d5aed81a8e015c1be2e5b664ccadaf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771438237","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966360/b1c9c88082adac49bc813ead956b5f13410bc778/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771438237","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966360/b1c9c88082adac49bc813ead956b5f13410bc778/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771438237","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AZ overslept all the way until homeroom was over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I really need to go home...&quot; <br>But something is wrong\u2014the schoolyard has changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the darkness, strange and unknown creatures begin to appear.<br>Now, survival is the only goal. And there's only one way: turn the familiar into weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Unique Combat with School Supplies</strong><br>Fight using pencils, rulers, scissors, and more!<br>Stab with pencils, slash with rulers, spin-cut with scissors\u2014<br>ordinary supplies become powerful weapons in satisfying combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>One Character, Infinite Growth</strong><br>Only one character, but endless possibilities!<br>A random mission system unlocks dozens of combat styles.<br>Each run is new. Each run, you grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Pixel Graphics &amp; Nostalgic Vibes</strong><br>Relive school days with cute pixel art and analog charm.<br>A simple, cozy feeling set in a familiar schoolyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>The More You Play, The Stronger You Get</strong><br>Unlock permanent upgrades through repeated play.<br>Survive longer and dive deeper in a meta-loop of endless growth!</p>","developers":["After School Vtuber"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared